msgstr "FRC Driver Station Log Viewer (仅支持Windows)"

#: ../../frc-docs/source/docs/controls-overviews/control-system-software.rst:61
msgid "Driver Station Log Viewer showing a logged practice session."
msgstr "机器操控台日志查看器显示已记录的练习会话"

#: ../../frc-docs/source/docs/controls-overviews/control-system-software.rst:64
msgid ""
"The FRC Driver Station Log Viewer is used to view logs created by the FRC "
"Driver Station. These logs contain a variety of information important for "
"understanding what happened during a practice session or FRC match. More "
"information about the FRC Driver Station Log Viewer and understanding the "
"logs can be found :ref:`here <docs/software/driverstation/driver-station-"
"log-viewer:Driver Station Log File Viewer>`"
msgstr ""
"FRC Driver Station日志查看器可用于查看FRC Driver Station创建的日志。 "
"这些日志包含各种信息，对于理解练习或FRC比赛期间发生的事情非常重要。 有关FRC Driver Station Log "
"Viewer和了解日志的更多信息，请参见 :ref:`此处 <docs/software/driverstation/driver-station-"
"log-viewer:Driver Station Log File Viewer>`"

